		 * Client-side `sessionId → color` store. The host API is the authority;
		 * a localStorage mirror keeps first paint instant (and keeps colors
		 * usable if the API is briefly unreachable). Snapshot is an immutable
		 * Map, replaced on every change, so React's useSyncExternalStore sees
